 "splits": {
  "62": [
   {
    "text": "She must have fallen.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "It's me, Scully.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "149": [
   {
    "text": "...and it starts a pandemic.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "Scully.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "151": [
   {
    "text": "No.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "A plague is released.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "160": [
   {
    "text": "The Smoking Man is dead.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "No. No, he's not.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "184": [
   {
    "text": "if the seizure was caused by the visions.",
    "speaker": "Dr. Joyet"
   },
   {
    "text": "I don't understand the difference.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "197": [
   {
    "text": "I need to get out of here.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "Scully.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "198": [
   {
    "text": "I have to get to the bottom of this, Mulder.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "Scully, I'm on this.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "234": [
   {
    "text": "I've taken a risk coming here.",
    "speaker": "Jeffrey Spender"
   },
   {
    "text": "What is it, Spender?",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "235": [
   {
    "text": "Someone came at me.",
    "speaker": "Jeffrey Spender"
   },
   {
    "text": "What do you mean?",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "236": [
   {
    "text": "Trying to find your son.",
    "speaker": "Jeffrey Spender"
   },
   {
    "text": "What did you tell them?",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "249": [
   {
    "text": "You've gotta calm down.",
    "speaker": "Dr. Joyet"
   },
   {
    "text": "I wanna get out of here.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "252": [
   {
    "text": "You can't keep me here.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "I fear you may seize.",
    "speaker": "Dr. Joyet"
   }
  ],
  "277": [
   {
    "text": "Then stay off the phone.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "It's okay, Mulder. I'm okay.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "280": [
   {
    "text": "What are you talking about?",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "He gave me a name. How to find our son.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "281": [
   {
    "text": "Something to start on.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "You can't be doing this now.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "283": [
   {
    "text": "Where are you?",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "I don't want you to worry.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "287": [
   {
    "text": "Mulder, I know what I'm doing.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "Damn it. Scully.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "294": [
   {
    "text": "I want you to listen to me.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "No.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "296": [
   {
    "text": "Why I need to find him.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "I'm gonna call Skinner.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "297": [
   {
    "text": "I need you to just stay put, okay?",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "I have to find our son.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "307": [
   {
    "text": "You think Scully will forgive you?",
    "speaker": "Monica Reyes"
   },
   {
    "text": "She'll come to see the beauty of it.",
    "speaker": "Cigarette-Smoking Man"
   }
  ],
  "310": [
   {
    "text": "These are people you're killing.",
    "speaker": "Monica Reyes"
   },
   {
    "text": "I'm just cleaning the mess that they made.",
    "speaker": "Cigarette-Smoking Man"
   }
  ],
  "320": [
   {
    "text": "Really? What makes you so certain?",
    "speaker": "Monica Reyes"
   },
   {
    "text": "It's a secret only you and I know.",
    "speaker": "Cigarette-Smoking Man"
   }
  ],
  "360": [
   {
    "text": "Your erstwhile father led the way.",
    "speaker": "Mr. Y"
   },
   {
    "text": "Answer my question.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "362": [
   {
    "text": "Surely you knew about this business.",
    "speaker": "Mr. Y"
   },
   {
    "text": "You're conspirators.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "367": [
   {
    "text": "I see. Nobody has a name.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "We've all had many names.",
    "speaker": "Erika Price"
   }
  ],
  "372": [
   {
    "text": "Hell-bent is what he is.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "--on exterminating humanity.",
    "speaker": "Erika Price"
   }
  ],
  "373": [
   {
    "text": "You'll be pleased to know, Mr. Skinner, I'm here to offer you a deal.",
    "speaker": "Cigarette-Smoking Man"
   }
  ],
  "376": [
   {
    "text": "Try me, you son of a bitch.",
    "speaker": "Cigarette-Smoking Man"
   },
   {
    "text": "I'm the one with the gun.",
    "speaker": "Walter Skinner"
   }
  ],
  "394": [
   {
    "text": "He needs the boy, Mr. Mulder.",
    "speaker": "Mr. Y"
   },
   {
    "text": "He'll never find him.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "395": [
   {
    "text": "You doubt his determination?",
    "speaker": "Erika Price"
   },
   {
    "text": "He'll use those closest to you.",
    "speaker": "Mr. Y"
   }
  ],
  "396": [
   {
    "text": "What does he want with my son?",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "That's the question, isn't it?",
    "speaker": "Erika Price"
   }
  ],
  "398": [
   {
    "text": "Why the hell do you care?",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "We want to save humanity.",
    "speaker": "Mr. Y"
   }
  ],
  "416": [
   {
    "text": "That's really the moon?",
    "speaker": "Young Jeffrey"
   },
   {
    "text": "Yes. That's really the moon, Jeffrey.",
    "speaker": "Cigarette-Smoking Man"
   }
  ],
  "433": [
   {
    "text": "...what's your budding enterprise?",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "The colonization of space.",
    "speaker": "Erika Price"
   }
  ],
  "444": [
   {
    "text": "Seven billion people?",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "That's not possible. Only a chosen few.",
    "speaker": "Erika Price"
   }
  ],
  "453": [
   {
    "text": "Get your ass back in the car.",
    "speaker": "Monica Reyes"
   },
   {
    "text": "I'm not finished.",
    "speaker": "Cigarette-Smoking Man"
   }
  ],
  "457": [
   {
    "text": "He's very important to me.",
    "speaker": "Cigarette-Smoking Man"
   },
   {
    "text": "You're asking me to betray them...",
    "speaker": "Walter Skinner"
   }
  ],
  "458": [
   {
    "text": "...to betray people that I care about.",
    "speaker": "Walter Skinner"
   },
   {
    "text": "Ha, ha. No, no, no.",
    "speaker": "Cigarette-Smoking Man"
   }
  ],
  "468": [
   {
    "text": "Hello?",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "I just wanted to tell you she's here...",
    "speaker": "Walter Skinner"
   }
  ],
  "470": [
   {
    "text": "Where is here?",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "The hospital.",
    "speaker": "Walter Skinner"
   }
  ],
  "512": [
   {
    "text": "Leave it alone, Mulder.",
    "speaker": "Walter Skinner"
   },
   {
    "text": "I asked you to look for her.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "513": [
   {
    "text": "I looked for her.",
    "speaker": "Walter Skinner"
   },
   {
    "text": "Where did you look?",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "524": [
   {
    "text": "She'll be with us. She's immune.",
    "speaker": "Cigarette-Smoking Man"
   },
   {
    "text": "You get off on this, don't you?",
    "speaker": "Walter Skinner"
   }
  ],
  "526": [
   {
    "text": "Mulder would kill me.",
    "speaker": "Walter Skinner"
   },
   {
    "text": "Scully will never take your offer.",
    "speaker": "Walter Skinner"
   }
  ],
  "541": [
   {
    "text": "How did I get out of my clothes and into bed?",
    "speaker": "Monica Reyes"
   },
   {
    "text": "We carried you, my housekeeper and I.",
    "speaker": "Cigarette-Smoking Man"
   }
  ]
 },
 "text": {
  "20": "It's been a humbling job, though I'm hardly known as a humble man.",
  "42": "It's a failure to recognize the limits of our own stupidity.",
  "46": "...our egos small enough.",
  "48": "I will leave my own mark upon history.",
  "74": "No news, good news, Mulder.\nThat's BS and you know it.",
  "135": "Massive contagion, alien DNA. Spartan Virus...",
  "201": "[GROANING]",
  "211": "If Scully was a conduit...",
  "242": "You don't understand. Mulder's life may depend on it.",
  "264": "That's the world we live in, Monica. Every day a new disaster.",
  "279": "Just listen to me, Mulder. Jeffrey Spender came to me.",
  "309": "Living as we were intended.",
  "323": "...and a man I had come to despise, my own father, was alive?",
  "349": "Ma'am, are you all right?\nMAN: Be careful.",
  "350": "Ma'am, you okay?\nWOMAN: Stand back, stand back.",
  "354": "We don't know where he is.\nThen who the hell are you?",
  "415": "Oh, my gosh, we did it.",
  "429": "...before he kills us all.",
  "441": "You want me to kill him so you can implement your own plan.",
  "442": "You wanna see blood in the streets.\nThe colonization of space?",
  "447": "You're a liar. You're all liars.",
  "478": "...now only doubled.",
  "501": "And William knows it.",
  "550": "I am.",
  "552": "[VOICES SPEAKING INDISTINCTLY]"
 },
